_paragraph\" >Alright, let\u2019s talk cards for a sec. Toilet paper. Slow cooker. You name it. We turned every store product into EPIC WARRIORS! And now they\u2019ve got some seriously crazy synergies. Example: you\u2019ve got a Level 3 Plastimorph and a Therapist on the field? Boom! Your Therapist triggers their power twice during battle. Don\u2019t get it yet? No worries. Let\u2019s play a round, you\u2019ll get it real quick. Ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/3e074be9134846d991a3830a589f7736.poster.avif?t=1760969517\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/3e074be9134846d991a3830a589f7736.webm?t=1760969517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Borealys Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/3bab6ca9bdcb711c94a0f8bf5818c32e4ee018e6/header.jpg?t=1760969517","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3002240/570466374/34f692e0ec6ce5415253f3613b61a1f1d3aea837/1758859632/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758862084","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3002240/570466374/34f692e0ec6ce5415253f3613b61a1f1d3aea837/1758859632/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758862084","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3002240/570466374/34f692e0ec6ce5415253f3613b61a1f1d3aea837/1758859632/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758862084","id":257206631,"name":"Reveal Trailer - Lunchbreak Tactics","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206631/80359f0e032a2